      ],
      "updated": 1784206052511,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pros:\n- Most Socially Acceptible\n- Don't have to Fight Parents\n- A \"defined\" path with small\nchance of getting utterly wrong\n\nCons:\n- Tedious Prep process\n- No garauntee for a good job\n- Fall 2027 is a timecrunch",
