      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1471820011,
      "version": 485,
      "versionNonce": 1070718283,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "pqO6GP5U5IKf39NLqKcE2",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783761933489,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pros:\n- The most effortless\noption\n- Get to learn how to\nleverage network\n\nCons:\n- Least secure (Most\nresults are controlled by\nother people)\n- Hardest to get started\nwith current status quo\n\n",
      "fontSize": 26.072347005208332,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pros:\n- The most effortless option\n- Get to learn how to leverage network\n\nCons:\n- Least secure (Most results are controlled by other people)\n- Hardest to get started with current status quo\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MThDyHjRdtj0-eME2gV01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 221.4216206868491,
      "y": -309.8366394042969,
      "width": 350.1677280180155,
      "height": 822.0333862304681,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 183674955,
      "version": 884,
      "versionNonce": 23942571,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "TwcbtIXpO6A-qK0dPcNFu",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1783761951222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pros:\n- Most Interesting Option\namongst all\n- Directly Reflects My\ndream career\n- Had been doing similar but\nsmaller scaled projects for a\nbit\n- Get to build a \"small\npersonal brand\" as a Dev\n- Get to collab and learn\nfrom influential figures in\nthe industry.\n\nCons:\n- Less \"defined\" path, and\nless socially acceptible.\n- Little to nobody to\nconsult with\n- Variabilities Remained\n    - Cannot garauntee\noutcome of my work\n    - Might get rejected,\nneglected by actually\ninfluential figures in the\nfield.",
      "fontSize": 25.29333496093748,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pros:\n- Most Interesting Option amongst all\n- Directly Reflects My dream career\n- Had been doing similar but smaller scaled projects for a bit\n- Get to build a \"small personal brand\" as a Dev\n- Get to collab and learn from influential figures in the industry.\n\nCons:\n- Less \"defined\" path, and less socially acceptible.\n- Little to nobody to consult with\n- Variabilities Remained\n    - Cannot garauntee outcome of my work\n    - Might get rejected, neglected by actually influential figures in the field.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
